.SH "NAME"
combine-pdf \- assemble, number, watermark, compress, encrypt and sign PDF booklets
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.sp
\fBcombine\-pdf\fP [\fISUBCOMMAND\fP] [\fIOPTIONS\fP] [\fIFILES\fP...]
.sp
\fBcombine\-pdf\fP \f(CRinit\fP [\f(CR\-r\fP] [\f(CR\-\-profile\fP \fINAME\fP] [\fIinit\-options\fP...]
.sp
\fBcombine\-pdf\fP [\f(CRbuild\fP]
.sp
\fBcombine\-pdf\fP \f(CRrefresh\fP [\f(CR\-r\fP]
.sp
\fBcombine\-pdf\fP \f(CRcompress\fP \fIFILE.pdf\fP [\f(CR\-o\fP \fIOUT.pdf\fP | \f(CR\-i\fP] [\f(CR\-L\fP] [\f(CR\-\-deep\fP]
.sp
\fBcombine\-pdf\fP \f(CRencrypt\fP|\f(CRdecrypt\fP \fIFILE.pdf\fP [\f(CR\-o\fP \fIOUT.pdf\fP | \f(CR\-i\fP] [\f(CR\-u\fP \fIPWD\fP] [\f(CR\-l\fP \fILEVEL\fP]
.sp
\fBcombine\-pdf\fP \f(CRrasterize\fP|\f(CRwatermark\fP|\f(CRgs\fP \fIFILE.pdf\fP [\fIoptions\fP...]
.sp
\fBcombine\-pdf\fP \f(CRsign\fP|\f(CRverify\fP \fIargs\fP...   (forwarded to \f(CRpdf\-sign\fP)
.sp
\fBcombine\-pdf\fP \f(CRmerge\fP|\f(CRassemble\fP|\f(CRnumber\fP \fIFILES\fP... (historic subcommands)
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.sp
\fBcombine\-pdf\fP is the Crystal port of the Ruby gem \f(CRcombine_pdf\fP, extended
into a declarative booklet builder. It reads a \fB.combine\-pdf.yml\fP file in
the current directory and produces a single PDF that:
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.  sp -1
.  IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
concatenates every listed file (plus optional special pages: see
\f(CRBLANK AND SEPARATOR ENTRIES\fP below);
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.  sp -1
.  IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
prepends a cover page and a clickable table of contents;
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.  sp -1
.  IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
numbers pages globally and inside partitions, with cover\-like pages
left uncounted;
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.  sp -1
.  IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
applies an optional diagonal/tiled/center text watermark;
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.  sp -1
.  IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
optionally encrypts the output (RC4\-128, AES\-128, AES\-256) and/or
signs it (PAdES B\-B / B\-T / B\-LT / B\-LTA, via \f(CRpdf\-sign\fP).
.RE
.sp
Without a subcommand, \fBcombine\-pdf\fP reads the YAML in the current
directory and builds the booklet.  The produced PDF opens automatically
in the system viewer when stdout and stderr are both interactive
terminals (macOS \f(CRopen\fP, Linux/BSD \f(CRxdg\-open\fP); pass \f(CR\-\-no\-open\fP to
disable this.
.SH "COMMANDS"
.sp
\fBinit\fP [\f(CR\-r\fP] [options]
.RS 4
Create a \fB.combine\-pdf.yml\fP in the current directory, prefilled with
the PDFs found there.  \f(CR\-r\fP/\f(CR\-\-recursive\fP lists PDFs in subdirectories
too.
.RE
.sp
\fBbuild\fP (or no subcommand)
.RS 4
Read the local YAML and produce the booklet.
.RE
.sp
\fBrefresh\fP [\f(CR\-r\fP]
.RS 4
Update the \f(CRfiles:\fP section of the YAML: append new PDFs at the end,
comment out entries whose file has disappeared.  Preserves comments,
order and titles.
.RE
.sp
\fBcompress\fP \fIFILE\fP [\f(CR\-o\fP \fIOUT\fP | \f(CR\-i\fP] [\f(CR\-L\fP] [\f(CR\-\-deep\fP]
.RS 4
Shrink a single PDF through uniform Flate recompression and
orphan\-object garbage collection (typical gain 30\-80%).
\f(CR\-L\fP/\f(CR\-\-linearize\fP enables Fast Web View (ISO 32000\-1 § F) and
requires \fBqpdf\fP.  \f(CR\-\-deep\fP adds image downsampling via Ghostscript
(requires \fBgs\fP).
.RE
.sp
\fBgs\fP \fIFILE\fP
.RS 4
Normalise a PDF through Ghostscript.  Use when the internal parser
refuses a malformed PDF (e.g. legacy linearised Acrobat files with
invalid zlib streams).
.RE
.sp
\fBencrypt\fP \fIFILE\fP [\f(CR\-l\fP \fILEVEL\fP] [\f(CR\-u\fP \fIUSER_PWD\fP] [\f(CR\-w\fP \fIOWNER_PWD\fP]
.RS 4
Encrypt a PDF (Standard Security Handler).  \fILEVEL\fP is one of
\f(CRrc4_128\fP, \f(CRaes_128\fP, \f(CRaes_256\fP (default).
.RE
.sp
\fBdecrypt\fP \fIFILE\fP [\f(CR\-u\fP \fIPWD\fP]
.RS 4
Strip the \f(CR/Encrypt\fP dictionary from a PDF.  An empty password is
used by default, which works for "owner\-only" protected files.
.RE
.sp
\fBrasterize\fP \fIFILE\fP [\f(CR\-\-dpi\fP \fIN\fP] [\f(CR\-\-quality\fP \fIQ\fP]
.RS 4
Render each page to a full\-page JPEG via Ghostscript and re\-embed it
in a new PDF.  Anti\-extraction / anti\-tampering trade\-off: no more
extractable text, larger files, degraded accessibility.
.RE
.sp
\fBwatermark\fP \fIFILE\fP \f(CR\-t\fP \fITEXT\fP [\f(CR\-s\fP \fISTYLE\fP]
.RS 4
Overlay a text watermark on every page.  \fISTYLE\fP is one of \f(CRdiagonal\fP
(default), \f(CRtiled\fP, \f(CRheader\fP, \f(CRfooter\fP, \f(CRcenter\fP.
.RE
.sp
\fBsign\fP \f(CR\-i\fP \fIIN\fP \f(CR\-o\fP \fIOUT\fP \f(CR\-c\fP \fICERT.p12\fP \f(CR\-p\fP \fIENV_VAR\fP [...], \fBverify\fP \fISIGNED.pdf\fP [\f(CR\-a\fP \fICA.pem\fP]
.RS 4
Thin forwarders to \f(CRpdf\-sign\fP (shard \fBaloli\-crystal/pdf\-signature\fP).
The signing passphrase is passed as the \fBname\fP of an environment
variable, never its value.
.RE
.sp
\fBmerge\fP \fIFILE1\fP \fIFILE2\fP ...
.RS 4
Concatenate PDFs into \f(CRmerged.pdf\fP (or \f(CR\-o\fP \fIOUT\fP).
.RE
.sp
\fBassemble\fP \fIFILE1\fP \fIFILE2\fP ...
.RS 4
Merge + automatic numbering in one shot (CLI equivalent of the YAML
booklet workflow).
.RE
.sp
\fBnumber\fP \fIFILE\fP
.RS 4
Number the pages of an existing PDF.
.RE
.sp
\fBhelp\fP [\fISUBCOMMAND\fP]
.RS 4
Print the short help; with a subcommand, show the matching section
of the full help.
.RE
.SH "OPTIONS"
.SS "Global"
.sp
\f(CR\-d\fP \fIDIR\fP, `\-\-dir=`\fIDIR\fP
.RS 4
Target directory (default: \f(CR.\fP).
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\-r\fP, \f(CR\-\-recursive\fP
.RS 4
Recursive mode for \f(CRinit\fP and \f(CRrefresh\fP.
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\-R\fP, \f(CR\-\-no\-flatten\-rotation\fP
.RS 4
Disable qpdf\(cqs \f(CR\-\-flatten\-rotation\fP pre\-processing of source PDFs
whose pages carry \f(CR/Rotate\fP ≠ 0 (macOS Preview case).
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\-\-no\-open\fP
.RS 4
Never open the produced PDF in the system viewer after \f(CRbuild\fP.
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\-h\fP, \f(CR\-\-help\fP
.RS 4
Print the short help.
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\-v\fP, \f(CR\-\-version\fP
.RS 4
Print the version.
.RE
.SS "init options"
.sp
`\-\-profile=`\fINAME\fP
.RS 4
One of \f(CRbooklet\fP (default), \f(CRbook\fP, \f(CRreport\fP, \f(CRslides\fP, \f(CRminimal\fP.
.RE
.sp
`\-\-author=`\fITEXT\fP
.RS 4
Override the author (default: \f(CRgit config user.name\fP).
.RE
.sp
`\-\-title=`\fITEXT\fP
.RS 4
Override the title (default: directory name).
.RE
.sp
`\-\-paper\-size=`\fISIZE\fP
.RS 4
\f(CRa4\fP (default), \f(CRletter\fP, \f(CRlegal\fP, \f(CRa3\fP, \f(CRa5\fP, \f(CRb5\fP, \f(CRexecutive\fP, or
\f(CRWxH\fP in points.
.RE
.sp
`\-\-cover=`\fIMODE\fP
.RS 4
\f(CRnone\fP (default), \f(CRrecto\fP, or \f(CRrecto\-verso\fP.
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\-\-duplex\fP
.RS 4
Generate \f(CRduplex: true\fP in the YAML.
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\-\-header\fP
.RS 4
Enable the partition header (per\-file title at the top of each page).
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\-\-toc\fP
.RS 4
Enable the title page and clickable table of contents.
.RE
.sp
`\-\-watermark=`\fITEXT\fP
.RS 4
Enable the watermark section with this text.
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\-\-no\-numbering\fP
.RS 4
Disable all numbering (\f(CRnumbering.enabled: false\fP).
.RE
.sp
`\-\-init\-format=`\fIFMT\fP
.RS 4
Override the global numbering format (default: \f(CR• %page% / %total% •\fP).
.RE
.sp
`\-\-init\-output=`\fIFILE\fP
.RS 4
Override the output PDF filename.
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\-\-skip\-header\fP, \f(CR\-\-skip\-toc\fP, \f(CR\-\-skip\-watermark\fP
.RS 4
Omit the corresponding section entirely from the generated YAML.
.RE
.sp
`\-\-user\-config=`\fIPATH\fP
.RS 4
Path to the user\-level config (default: \f(CR$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/combine\-pdf/config.yml\fP).
.RE
.SS "compress options"
.sp
\f(CR\-i\fP, \f(CR\-\-in\-place\fP
.RS 4
Overwrite the input file atomically through a `.tmp.`\fIPID\fP file.
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\-\-backup\fP
.RS 4
Keep the original as \f(CR.bak\fP when combined with \f(CR\-i\fP.
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\-L\fP, \f(CR\-\-linearize\fP
.RS 4
Enable Fast Web View (ISO 32000\-1 § F).  Requires \fBqpdf\fP.  Do NOT
combine with a PAdES\-signed PDF.
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\-\-deep\fP
.RS 4
Deep compression through Ghostscript (image downsampling, JPEG,
fonts).  Requires \fBgs\fP.
.RE
.sp
`\-\-deep\-quality=`\fIQ\fP
.RS 4
Ghostscript preset: \f(CRscreen\fP, \f(CRebook\fP (default), \f(CRprinter\fP, \f(CRprepress\fP.
.RE
.SS "encrypt options"
.sp
\f(CR\-l\fP \fILEVEL\fP, `\-\-level=`\fILEVEL\fP
.RS 4
\f(CRrc4_128\fP, \f(CRaes_128\fP, or \f(CRaes_256\fP (default).
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\-u\fP \fIPWD\fP, `\-\-user\-password=`\fIPWD\fP
.RS 4
User password (empty: no open password, owner\-only restrictions).
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\-w\fP \fIPWD\fP, `\-\-owner\-password=`\fIPWD\fP
.RS 4
Owner password (default: same as user password).
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\-p\fP \fILIST\fP, `\-\-permissions=`\fILIST\fP
.RS 4
CSV of \f(CRprint\fP, \f(CRcopy\fP, \f(CRmodify\fP, \f(CRannotate\fP, or \f(CRnone\fP / \f(CRall\fP.
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\-I\fP \fIPWD\fP, `\-\-input\-password=`\fIPWD\fP
.RS 4
Password to try on encrypted input PDFs (used by \f(CRbuild\fP and \f(CRdecrypt\fP).
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\-\-encrypt\fP, \f(CR\-\-no\-encrypt\fP
.RS 4
Force encryption on/off during \f(CRbuild\fP, overriding the YAML.
.RE
.SS "rasterize options"
.sp
`\-\-dpi=`\fIN\fP
.RS 4
Rendering resolution in dpi (default: 200).  150 = screen, 300 =
printable.
.RE
.sp
`\-\-quality=`\fIQ\fP
.RS 4
JPEG quality 0\-100 (default: 85).
.RE
.SS "watermark options"
.sp
\f(CR\-t\fP \fITEXT\fP, `\-\-text=`\fITEXT\fP
.RS 4
Watermark text (required for \f(CRwatermark\fP).
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\-s\fP \fISTYLE\fP, `\-\-style=`\fISTYLE\fP
.RS 4
\f(CRdiagonal\fP (default), \f(CRtiled\fP, \f(CRheader\fP, \f(CRfooter\fP, \f(CRcenter\fP.
.RE
.sp
`\-\-opacity=`\fIO\fP
.RS 4
Opacity 0.0\-1.0 (default: 0.15).
.RE
.sp
`\-\-rotation=`\fIA\fP
.RS 4
Rotation in degrees (default: 45 for diagonal/tiled, 0 otherwise).
.RE
.sp
`\-\-wm\-color=`\fIR,G,B\fP
.RS 4
RGB watermark color 0.0\-1.0 (default: \f(CR0.5,0.5,0.5\fP).
.RE
.sp
`\-\-wm\-font\-size=`\fIN\fP
.RS 4
Font size (default: 48).
.RE
.SS "Historic subcommand options (\f(CRmerge\fP / \f(CRassemble\fP / \f(CRnumber\fP)"
.sp
\f(CR\-o\fP \fIFILE\fP, `\-\-output=`\fIFILE\fP
.RS 4
Output file.
.RE
.sp
`\-\-font\-size=`\fISIZE\fP
.RS 4
Text size (default: 10).
.RE
.sp
`\-\-color=`\fIR,G,B\fP
.RS 4
RGB text color (default: \f(CR0.2,0.2,0.2\fP).
.RE
.sp
`\-\-margin=`\fIPT\fP
.RS 4
Margin in points (default: 24).
.RE
.sp
`\-\-global\-format=`\fIFMT\fP
.RS 4
Global numbering format (default: \f(CR%page%/%total%\fP).
.RE
.sp
`\-\-partition\-format=`\fIFMT\fP
.RS 4
Intra\-partition format.
.RE
.sp
`\-\-partitions=`\fILIST\fP
.RS 4
Comma\-separated sizes (e.g. \f(CR4,2,1\fP).
.RE
.sp
`\-\-skip=`\fIPAGES\fP
.RS 4
1\-based page numbers not to number (comma\-separated).
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\-\-show\-single\-partitions\fP
.RS 4
Show the intra\-partition number even for single\-page partitions.
.RE
.SH "CONFIGURATION"
.sp
A full \f(CR.combine\-pdf.yml\fP looks like this:
.sp
.if n .RS 4
.nf
.fam C
output: booklet.pdf
title: "My booklet"
author: "Jane Doe"
paper_size: a4
duplex: false

numbering:
  enabled: true
  global:
    enabled: true
    format: "• %page% / %total% •"

toc:
  enabled: true

watermark:
  enabled: false
  text: "DRAFT"
  style: diagonal
  opacity: 0.15

encrypt:
  enabled: false
  level: aes_256
  user_password: ""
  owner_password: ""
  permissions: [print]

files:
  \- chapter\-1.pdf
  \- chapter\-2.pdf
.fam
.fi
.if n .RE
.SS "BLANK AND SEPARATOR ENTRIES"
.sp
Since 1.0.31.52, the \f(CRfiles:\fP list accepts two reserved keywords
alongside regular paths.
.sp
\f(CR\- blank\fP
.RS 4
Insert a blank page (A4 by default, or \f(CRpaper_size\fP).  Counted and
numbered by default.  A scalar sets the TOC bookmark:
\f(CR\- blank: "Preface"\fP.
.RE
.sp
\f(CR\- separator\fP
.RS 4
Insert a blank page with its own big, faint centered text watermark
(useful for "intentionally blank" or chapter title pages).  The
scalar form provides the overlaid text: \f(CR\- separator: "The End"\fP.
.RE
.sp
All four YAML shapes are accepted:
.sp
.if n .RS 4
.nf
.fam C
files:
  \- blank\&                                               # bare keyword
  \- blank: "Preface"\&                                    # scalar
  \- blank: {title: "Preface", number: hide}\&             # flow mapping
  \- separator:\&                                          # block mapping
      text: "The End"
      number: skip
      font_size: 48
      opacity: 0.4
      color: [0.3, 0.3, 0.3]
.fam
.fi
.if n .RE
.sp
\f(CRnumber\fP takes one of three values:
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.  sp -1
.  IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
\f(CRshow\fP (default) \- counted and numbered;
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.  sp -1
.  IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
\f(CRhide\fP \- counted but no number printed (removes the number badge
while keeping numbering consistent with physical page count);
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.  sp -1
.  IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
\f(CRskip\fP \- not counted, no number, no TOC bookmark (cover\-like).
.RE
.sp
Options accepted by \f(CRseparator\fP: \f(CRtext\fP, \f(CRtitle\fP, \f(CRnumber\fP, \f(CRfont_size\fP,
\f(CRopacity\fP, \f(CRcolor\fP (RGB triple, 0.0\-1.0).
.SH "FILES"
.sp
\fI$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/combine\-pdf/config.yml\fP
.RS 4
User\-level defaults for \f(CRinit\fP (profile, author, paper size,
watermark text). Falls back to \f(CR~/.config/combine\-pdf/config.yml\fP.
.RE
.sp
\fI./.combine\-pdf.yml\fP
.RS 4
Per\-booklet configuration read by \f(CRbuild\fP / \f(CRrefresh\fP.
.RE
.SH "EXAMPLES"
.sp
Create a YAML and build the booklet:
.sp
.if n .RS 4
.nf
.fam C
$ combine\-pdf init \-r \-\-profile book \-\-paper\-size a4 \-\-toc
$ combine\-pdf
✓ Booklet built: booklet.pdf
.fam
.fi
.if n .RE
.sp
Make a draft with a watermark on the fly:
.sp
.if n .RS 4
.nf
.fam C
$ combine\-pdf watermark report.pdf \-t "DRAFT" \-s diagonal \-i
.fam
.fi
.if n .RE
.sp
Encrypt the booklet as part of the build:
.sp
.if n .RS 4
.nf
.fam C
$ combine\-pdf \-\-encrypt \-u "s3cret"
.fam
.fi
.if n .RE
.sp
Protect a RIB (bank details) from extraction:
.sp
.if n .RS 4
.nf
.fam C
$ combine\-pdf watermark rib.pdf \-t "FOR LANDLORD X — 2026\-11\-11" \-s tiled \-i
$ combine\-pdf rasterize rib.pdf \-i
.fam
.fi
.if n .RE
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.sp
\fB0\fP
.RS 4
Success.
.RE
.sp
\fB1\fP
.RS 4
Any error (missing file, malformed YAML, invalid option, Ghostscript
failure, encryption/password mismatch, ...).
.RE
.SH "ENVIRONMENT"
.sp
\fBXDG_CONFIG_HOME\fP
.RS 4
Overrides the location of the user\-level config.
.RE
